window.products.push({"id":743011,"name":"FoodyWoo - Bamboo Steamer Basket 10 Inch, 2 Tier w/ 2 Pairs of Chopsticks, 2 Cotton Steamer Liners, 25 Parchment Liners - Cooking Food, Rice, Fish, Ve","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71uPQfhYJoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Our 10-inch Bamboo Steamer Baskets are carefully handmade with high-quality bamboo wood, ensuring excellent durability, sturdiness, and stability. Quick & Easy Are you always on the go? Have food prepared in less than 15 minutes! The 2-tier steamer allows you to cook multiple food items at once. In combination with consistently high heat distribution, this allows you to prepare your food in a shorter duration. The bamboo lid keeps the steam in, ensuring everything cooks evenly and no condensation is formed. HEALTHIER Looking for a healthier option? Steaming your food is a great way to retain vital nutrients, such as vitamins and minerals, as opposed to boiling. Make a smarter choice by removing the excess use of oil and preserve the natural flavors! VERSATILE Do you like multitasking? The versatility of the steamer basket allows you to steam almost anything. The 2-tier steamer allows you to cook higher volumes of food at once. Combine any of the following food items – sticky rice, fish, vegetables, beef, pork, poultry, seafood, Chinese buns, Asian dumplings, momos, dim sum, bao buns – and so much more! EASY TO CARE 1) Clean the steamer immediately after every use. 2) Gently wash the steamer with a sponge or nylon scrubber and mild dish soap, and rinse in warm water. 3) Allow the steamer to air dry for at least 2 days before storing it away. 4) For lingering odors, rub a slice of lemon on the steamer. 5) DO NOT PLACE THE BAMBOO STEAMER BASKET IN THE DISHWASHER! Don’t you hate using 30 minutes of your day washing your dishes? Save the hassle and use a bamboo steamer basket! Our product includes 2 cotton steamer liners and 25 parchment liners, which protect the stackable tiers from sticky foods and stubborn smells from absorbing into the bamboo. The cotton steamer liners are washable and reusable, which lasts for a very long time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71uPQfhYJoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FoodyWoo","source_asin":"B08CZKBHCX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-743011","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08CZKBHCX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08CZKBHCX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
