window.products.push({"id":743111,"name":"Total 90 Pcs, Pampas Grasss 18\" Set | 30 Pcs White Pampas and Natural Dried Pampas Grass,60 Pcs Rabbit Tail Grass, Perfect Bouquet for Boho Home Decor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/714gBCKY2uL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"90 Pcs Natural dried pampas grass with 3 different color for you to decorate your beautiful home. Our focuses on providing innovative and affordable home decoration products to enhance your personal oasis feeling and style without compromising their texture or resistance. To ensure the quality, all pampas are handpicked and carefully selected for your bouquet. Fantastic Features Freedom of Collocation; Perfect for home decor, garden, restaurant, hotel, store, wedding, etc., anywhere you want flowers to decorate. Natural Dried Flowers; Beautiful gift for Mother's Day, Valentine's Day, birthday and other special events. Fluffy and elegant; Ideal for weddings or bohemian home decorations. Perfect Gift Idea; Create a relaxing and beautiful atmosphere with our Dried Pampas Grass Decor! Specifications: Package: 90 Stems + Protective square Box. Length: 18\" (46cm) in total. Color: Natural and  White Brown Pampas Grass Care Tips : 1.When you first take it out of the package you should gently shake it a little outside — allowing excess plume shedding to occur. 2.You can put it in the sun for several hours to make pampas grass fluffy. 3.Arrange pampas grass reeds in your vase, delicately styling the plume, then use the setting hairspray to spray gently, this will help maintain the bulkiness and helps to keep shedding at bay! 4.Pampas grass are dried, they do not require any water. To maintain your plumes, re-spray every 6 months to help maintain fullness. 5.Keep it away from any sources of ignition such as candles.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/714gBCKY2uL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ayieyill","source_asin":"B09J8SL95K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-743111","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09J8SL95K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09J8SL95K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
