window.products.push({"id":743149,"name":"Reusable Ice Cube, 40Pcs Plastic Ice Cubes, Quick-Freeze Easy-to-Clean Refreezable Fake Ice Cubes for Making Cold Appealing Drinks, Lunch Bags, Cooler","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71wkTWdP4WL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"NO MORE DILUTED DRINKS! These plastic ice cubes can be quickly frozen. They come in handy when you want to enjoy a cold drink. Different from regular ice cubes, these non-melting ice cubes will NOT water down(destroy) your drinks. SAFE MATERIALS. These reusable ice cubes are made from TPU, a kind of superior plastics which is safer to use. TPU features a high elasticity. So these ice cubes for drinks would not crack or leak easily. What's inside the cubes are purified water. Even in the rare event of cracking, they would do NO harm at all. REFREEZABLE. It's super easy to reuse these plastic ice cubes. Just rinse off, pat dry, and pop them back into the freezer for your next drinks. No need of cracking an ice cube tray nor refilling it up with water. SUPER VALUE. What in the package are 40 pieces of fake ice cubes reusable. You would find multiple purposes they could well serve. Make cold drinks like cocktails, coffee, tea, beer, soda, OJ, milk... You may also improvise an ice pack by pouring them into a baggie without the the drippy mess of melting ice. Also they can help you cool your food. Yet more is to be discovered by you in person! MORE FUN! Assorted colors and various shapes of these non-melting ice cubes would definitely bring more fun to your drinks. Small enough for sippy cups! So even kids would love to have these cute ice cubes floating in their cups.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71wkTWdP4WL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"YGFRSTO","source_asin":"B0B6FF2XVG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-743149","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B6FF2XVG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B6FF2XVG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
