window.products.push({"id":743349,"name":"NOVICA Large Brown Romantic Cedar Wood Sculpture, 17.75\" Tall 'Love Infinity'","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Ea0uJCBQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"NOVICA, in association with National Geographic, works together with talented artisan designers around the world to produce stunning, keepsake treasures. Our mantra is to spread global happiness, so rest assured - we’ll do everything we possibly can to ensure you’re a happy customer. About this item: Lithe acrobats form the symbol for infinity with their bodies. Forever joined, they represent endless love. Ghana's Kwame Kandavi carves this extraordinary image from fragrant cedar wood. \"This piece talks about love. With love for each other, the whole world will be united and peaceful,\" he says. - Each artwork is unique -- wood grain, color, and pattern will differ slightly from picture About our Artist: \"I was born in 1973 in Aburi in Ghana. I ended my education at school level as my father wasn't sending any remittances while my mother, a petty trader, couldn't afford the cost. During school days, I used to visit a carver friend who needed an assistant. I assisted him and used the opportunity to study woodcarving. Later, I took up apprenticeship under Edward Osei who was into woodcarving. It took me 3 years to complete the training. I worked for my trainer for a year which helped me to practice my acquired skill. Praise for my carvings encouraged me to carve my own products and propelled me into the profession. I got orders from colleagues & church members. I'm currently operating a workshop. I use materials like sese wood, dark tan, black, brown polish and mansion polish. The wood is carved, sandpapered, dried and polished for a smooth and quality product. I've been on my own for four years and trained four people who have now established their own shops. All in all, life has been good.\"","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Ea0uJCBQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NOVICA","source_asin":"B001767G80","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-743349","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B001767G80","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B001767G80","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
