window.products.push({"id":743445,"name":"Gifts Amor Hooded Towel, Bath Pool Beach Poncho for Kids, Quick Dry/Sand Resistant, Medium (5-12 Year Old), Flowers","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61rrTFeHIbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Ready to take bath time, beach time, pool time to the next level with these hooded towel ponchos?? Kids will love the designs and you'll love the convenience. We take them everywhere we go and are always getting compliments! For smaller kids, the poncho will be oversized, allowing for privacy and keeping them warm and protected from the sun. Size SMALL will fit a wide range from bigger 3 year olds to more petite 10 year olds. The MEDIUM is comparable to a youth XL or an adult XS-Small Tshirt. HAVE A BLAST AT THE BEACH - No more towels flying away or whining about who has to carry the towel! Shake off the sand, dry off the kid, and they'll want to wear this rest of the day! BONUS, Our oversize design with hood will keep them warm and safe from the sun. FOR GIRLS: Our hooded towel poncho doubles as an adorable swim suit cover up. MORE SMILES AT THE POOL - Use the hooded towel poncho to dry off and slide right over bathing suit. For toddlers, length and width is generous to allow for sliding off a wet bathing suit, putting on new dry bottoms or pullups in privacy. But good luck getting them to take it off! BATH NIGHT IN STYLE - Our quality microfiber is gentle on skin and quick absorbing. Slide the hooded towel on and they'll finish drying in style and be comfy and cuddle ready heading into nighttime routines. ADD TO CART WITH CONFIDENCE - We know you won't be disappointed but should there ever be an issue, we stand behind all our products and will do what we can to ensure 100% customer satisfaction,even if that means a refund.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61rrTFeHIbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Gifts Amor","source_asin":"B09Y2W8DYF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-743445","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09Y2W8DYF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09Y2W8DYF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":743446,"name":"Rae Dunn Christmas Tree Collar - Base Decoration to Cover Artificial Christmas Tree Stand – Natural Woven - Rustic & Farmhouse Holiday Decorations - C","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":61.45,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81BZvAROVQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Tired of the mess left by a traditional Christmas tree skirt? Decorate the base of your Christmas tree with this Santa-approved Christmas Tree Collar from Rae Dunn. Perfect for improving the look of artificial Christmas trees with unsightly metal stands and visible tripod bases.PRODUCT FEATURES:Christmas Tree CollarNatural WovenDecorative and PracticalReusable Holiday DecorDimensions: 20” x 20”CHRISTMAS DECORATIONS, YEAR AFTER YEARThe moment the Thanksgiving leftovers are put away... it’s time to begin celebrating Christmas! Turn up your favorite Xmas playlist and deck the halls this season with the help of Rae Dunn. Our signature Christmas tree collars mesh seamlessly with rustic, farmhouse, country, and natural design styles. Perfect for homes, offices, business, lobbies, waiting rooms, and seasonal storefront displays. Reuse year after year – our timeless pieces never go out of style!STOPS PETS & PET DANDERGot pets? Our premium tree collars keep dogs, cats, and other animals away from your Christmas tree base. Stops pets from drinking water from the base or chewing on the trunk. 360° high-walled design prevents fur, hair, feathers, dust, and dander from getting onto your tree. Does not shed or cause a mess like a traditional tree skirt.RAE DUNNCalifornia artist, ceramicist and author, Rae Dunn, finds beauty in simple shapes, imperfection and found objects. \"In my own way, I am driven to find the balance between expressing something that is deeply meaningful to me and creating a sense of joy that might quietly touch the lives of others.\"Rae's designs are known for their functionality, design, and durability. Rae's signature font gives every item a personal touch and adds to the simple beauty of her designs.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81BZvAROVQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Rae Dunn","source_asin":"B09KT5NV4V","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-743446","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09KT5NV4V","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09KT5NV4V","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
