window.products.push({"id":743487,"name":"Monamour 10 OZ Porcelain Matte Serving Bowl Set, 4.75 Inch Small Dipping Sauce Bowls for Ice Cream, Dessert, Small Side Dishes, Condiments, Set of 6 (","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":111.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ExfWH1iZL._AC_SL1180_.jpg","description":"I. ABOUT MATTE GLAZE -The formation of matte texture is due to the micro-crystal generating during the cooling phase, which required a particular (slower) cooling schedule after the firing. Numerous micro crystals generating during this process, which refract the light, makes the ceramic product matte. -The matte glaze is the trend of modern ceramic products, which is produced with advanced craftsmanship. Matte glazes can be just as “smooth” as gloss glazes, yet without fierce reflection of light, which gives it a visual effect of gentleness, coziness, which is simple, natural and yet elegant. -It is easy to clean and anti-slip due to the smooth matte texture. II. Product Description -If you are looking for good quality and differentiated bowls, this will be the perfect choice for you. Our bowls feature matte texture and petal-shape design, simple and yet elegant. It is designed to stands out from ordinary bowls. -Made of the high-quality clay and fired under high temperature, which makes our bowls much harder, more resistant to cracking. It’s also lead-free, non-toxic, safe and healthy. -Microwave and dishwasher safe, and easy to clean. With a nice polished lip which makes stacking easily. -Measures 4.75 in diameter, small size bowl for ice cream, yogurt, rice, soup, small snacks, fruit, sauce and etc., and also a good dinnerware to control your everyday diet. III. Tips -Do not scrape the surface with sharp tableware. -Avoid fast temperature changes such jumping from the freezer to the microwave","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ExfWH1iZL._AC_SL1180_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Monamour","source_asin":"B0824QCT47","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-743487","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0824QCT47","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0824QCT47","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
