window.products.push({"id":743731,"name":"Aizbao 380ml Portable Blender, Six Blades 3D Juice 380ml cup, Small Fruit Mixer, Personal Mixer Fruit Rechargeable with USB, Mini Blender for Milk Sha","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/01RmK+J4pJL._AC_.gif","description":"Want to enjoy a fresh smoothie, milkshake or baby food anytime, anywhere Specification:1. Max. power: 175W2. Motor: DC 7.4V, 22000 rpm±15Percent3. Battery volume: 2000mAh4. Blade material: 304 Stainless Steel, 6 Blades in 3D5. Capacity: 17oz6. Cup material: AS (BPA free)7. Cup Weight: 0.5 lb8.Cup height size: 3x3x6inch9. Blender Dimensions: 3x3x9inch10. Blender Weight: 1.3 lbPackage included:1 x Portable Blender1 x USB Charging Cable1 x User ManualWhen you get your blender, please pay attention to the following tips:1. Don't put your hands inside your blender or try to touch the blades. Don't use your blender when charging or run your blender without anything inside.2. Don't recommend hot liquids over 50 degree which will be easy cause damage or leakage.3. Charge your blender before your first use. The lights turns red while charging and blue once full charged.4. Recommend cutting your fruit or other ingredients into small chunks. Always start by adding a liquid such as water or milk. You can blend ice. Make sure your blender with sufficient liquid inside first, and that your cubes aren't too large. Red and blue flashing lights mean your jar isn't aligned with your base. To fix this, the arrow on the jar should line up with the switch on the base. Red flashing lights mean your blender needs to be recharged or that your blades are blocked. Recharge or shake your blender.If you have any questions, please contact us, we will have a dedicated customer service to answer any questions for you","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/01RmK+J4pJL._AC_.gif","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Aizbao","source_asin":"B095GX9VTN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-743731","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B095GX9VTN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B095GX9VTN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
