window.products.push({"id":743762,"name":"Metal Straws Reusable Stainless Steel Straws with Silicone Tips Eco On the Go Set Includes 10.5\" Ultra Long + 8.5\" Thick Milkshake Straw + Straight + ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71yc4orEuJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"CONVENIENT, LOGIC DESIGN AND HIGH DURABILITY Eco On the Go Premium Quality Reusable Stainless Steel Straws were designed by a user for the user, so we know exactly what we are offering.Includes a convenient carrying pouch.Use them in the park on a picnic, restaurants and fast food places, food courts, the beach, road trips and travels and even lunch at work. DISHWASHER SAFE Our Stainless Steel reusable drinking straw set comes with a cleaning brush for the inside, and they’re dishwasher safe too. You get the best set of straws that not only comes in two different thicknesses but also different lengths and designs; slim for soft drinks, sodas and refreshments, thick for smoothies, frozens, slurpies or any other kind of thick beverage, and the novelty spoon straw used to stir and drink with the same utensil, so you won’t ever need a plastic straw or stirrer again when drinking your favorite sangria or tapioce beverage or all natural chunky fruit beverage. USE WITH COLD OR HOT Set also includes 4 different convenient silicon tips so you don’t have to worry if the drink is hot or too cold, therefore they are the perfect companion all day, every day in every occasion. JOIN THE REUSABLE MOVEMENT Eco on the Go Premium Quality Stainless Steel Straws won't rust and help prevent staining your teeth from colored drinks, tea, coffee and wine for example. Our food grade metal straws are rounded at the tips to avoid sharp edges, so they are perfectly safe for use, and unlike plastic straws, these will not bend or break. Also they are reusable and can last a long time. Eco on the Go stainless steel reusable straws are a the best alternative to your traditional plastic straw.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71yc4orEuJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Eco on the Go","source_asin":"B07SZR4KBQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-743762","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07SZR4KBQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07SZR4KBQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
