window.products.push({"id":743797,"name":"Lazzari Collections Personalized Pet Dog Cat Memorial 12\"x6\" Engraved Black Granite Grave Marker Head Stone Plaque CHA3","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71JjhzC3XyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"On a personal note from us to you: We are dog people as well. We are proudly owned by them. Never ever a harder day than the moment they moved on --WE DO UNDERSTAND. Use the contact seller email to send us the info and photo you would like. We will need a picture of your beloved pet emailed to us along with his/her name and anything special you may want us to include. We will edit your photo with care, removing or simplifying background if needed or requested, in order to produce the best presentation possible. The Granite is engraved with: Your Pet's Picture and a pair of paw prints. The engraved text (you can have whatever you like), as a default we have: \"Forever Loved,\" Your Pet's Name, Dates of birth and passing, and \"Thank you for being the best friend anyone could ever ask for... You will be truly missed\". Thank you very much for your purchase and allowing us to help. This piece of Frosted Engraved Granite measures 12 inches x 6 inches and a thick 3/8ths inches in depth. The black, natural stone tile is polished with a smooth surface and a high sheen. Being a natural product, which means there can be variations in color and pattern, and sometimes what you get delivered may be touch different than what you see in the display but as in nature all is most acceptable.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71JjhzC3XyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lazzari Collections","source_asin":"B00MAQTCPG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-743797","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00MAQTCPG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00MAQTCPG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
