window.products.push({"id":743850,"name":"Sapphire Linens Bed Sheets Set 600 Thread Count 100% Pure Egyptian Cotton 24 Inches Deep Pocket with Soft Touch !!! (King, Aqua Blue)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71IT5TyydnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Our products are designed to support your body for a healthy night's rest and our bed products are designed to maximize your comfort and luxury for a perfect sleep experience. our promise is to create premium sleep products that encompass the best of the traditional craft of mattress fabrication and design. We are committed to provide the highest qualified and optimum advances in the technology and science of sleep, those that have shown genuine results in getting our customers the healthiest and most comfortable sleeping environment they will ever experience. Experience the best in affordable luxury with these 100% Genuine Egyptian Cotton Sheet Sets. Egyptian cotton is hand-picked which puts less stress on the fibres, leaving them straight and intact. These fibers can be made longer to create very fine yarns which make it possible to make yarns without sacrificing the length, giving stronger and softer cotton, unlike regular cotton which has more splices. Now you can conveniently buy comfortable luxury bedding in a single package rather than purchasing each item separately. It is often advantageous to buy a sheet set than to buy everything separately. This sheet set include 1 fitted sheet, 1 flat sheet and 2 pillow cases. These sheets are soft, comfortable, perfect for everyday use, and sure to bring a little bit of paradise to your home. These single ply sheets have a lustrous sateen finish and fully elasticized fitted sheet with deep pockets. our mission is to make a difference in the sleep and health of customers through handcrafting the highest quality bedding products. With a family legacy in the field of mattress manufacturing, our initial passion was to provide a range of products that greatly improved the lives of customers.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71IT5TyydnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sapphire Linens","source_asin":"B00LA8E9FS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-743850","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00LA8E9FS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00LA8E9FS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
