window.products.push({"id":743853,"name":"Sytas Home Office Chair Ergonomic, Mesh Desk Chair Lumbar Support, Ergonomic Computer Chair Adjustable Armrest","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":139.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61XY9iFrygL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"【Elegant&Modern Design】The ergonomic office chair design is sleek and simple. The desk office chair is an adjustment mid-back ergonomic desk chair. Based on structural mechanics principles, the ergonomic office chair is a compelling seating choice. This ergonomic office chair can be used with any space. 【Ergonomic&Extra Comfort】The desk office chair has ergonomic backrest and lumbar support fit the natural curve of the lower back and take the pain of spinal away from your body. High density double layer mesh back, flexible supportive, breathable. Thick padded seat cushion provides all day comfort. 【Comfortable Tilt Tension】Unlike traditional chairs, Sytas adjustable desks chair has a 90°-120° tilt tension. When you work, the desk office chair have “S” backrest can protect your spine; when you want to relax, please pull out the adjustment lever of the desk chair to relax your body. This simple ergonomic office chair is also very space-saving. 【Multiple Adjustment】This simple ergonomic office chair has many functions. The 10cm gas lift that can be adjusted up and down can meet the needs of people of different body types. The 90° flip-up armrests save your house space. 360° swivel make you use it flexibility all day. 【Stable & Durable】This ergonomic office chair has high bearing capacity base, metal chair legs with smooth and silenced rolling wheels, max capacity 250lbs. Our ergonomic office chair team will provide you with high-quality service, if you have any questions, please feel free to contact us via Amazon.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61XY9iFrygL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sytas","source_asin":"B09LQP9BXD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-743853","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09LQP9BXD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09LQP9BXD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":743854,"name":"Starry Dynamo 21-Inch Burgundy Red/White Farmhouse Knit Christmas Stockings Set (6-Pack (Big & Little Reindeer, Snowflakes, Xmas Tree, Angel, Snowman)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91c0Jc+ZVcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"About These Stockings by Starry Dynamo: High-definition stitching exhibits beautifully knit reindeer and snowflakes against a background of intricately set Christmas elements High-definition stitching exhibits beautifully knit reindeer and snowflakes against a background of intricately set Christmas elements Red-white Scandinavian inspired shapes add a modern look to a homespun knitted design, matches well with a variety of home mantle decorations Red-white Scandinavian inspired shapes add a modern look to a homespun knitted design, matches well with a variety of home mantle decorations Thick hand-knit yarn and durable loop that lets you hang them anywhere from traditional holders to wall hooks, door knobs, and staircase railings Thick hand-knit yarn and durable loop that lets you hang them anywhere from traditional holders to wall hooks, door knobs, and staircase railings Machine washable stockings make for a long-lasting piece of Christmas cheer you'll love to hang up year after year Machine washable stockings make for a long-lasting piece of Christmas cheer you'll love to hang up year after year Comes in convenient sets and matching patterns for the whole family, available in 2, 3, 4, 5 or 6 for one affordable price Comes in convenient sets and matching patterns for the whole family, available in 2, 3, 4, 5 or 6 for one affordable price FAQs: Can these stockings be personalized? We cannot personalize the stockings since they are shipped directly from Amazon warehouses for fast delivery. For those who knit, the cuff measures 2.8\" in length which is plenty of room to stitch on a name or initials. How much can you fit into each stocking? Larger than a typical stocking, each measures 21\" long and 6\" wide (54 x 15 cm). They fit all kinds of stuffers including bottled perfume, cosmetics, toy trucks, boxed candies, portable speakers, stuffed animals, books, and more. Don't worry about the weight - the sturdy loops can withstand at least as much weight as your stocking holder or hook. Can I choose which stocking goes in the set of 2? Currently, the set of 2 stockings only comes in the little reindeer + snowflake pair. The big reindeer stocking is available in the set of 3 and above. How do I clean them? These stockings are made of 100% machine washable material. Air or line dry.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91c0Jc+ZVcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Starry Dynamo","source_asin":"B0B1B3JC6R","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-743854","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B1B3JC6R","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B1B3JC6R","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
