window.products.push({"id":743858,"name":"EZMO Apple Peeler, Pear Peeler with 8 Wedges Apple Slicer and Corer, Stainless Steel Blades Apple Cutter","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71KzATAQlXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Quickly and easily peel, core and slice any apple variety. Flexible swing of the blade accommodates variety of apple size, blade cuts a wider peel than the more usual sort of metal peelers making it faster Peel is thinner, hardly any apple meat coming off comparing with motorized peelers which lose a ton of fruit. Comes with a Slicer and Corer to serve sliced apples or prepare apple pies, with 4 welding points on each blade highly attached on the central corer ring, enables a stronger and more durable daily using. The suction cups held the peeler in place steadily, effortlessly use for aging hands that are not as flexible, works easily for kids as well. Easy to clean, simply put the blade and prong under running water, then store it in a dry place, a ventilated area to let it air dry completely.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71KzATAQlXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"EZMO","source_asin":"B08QZQY1JF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-743858","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08QZQY1JF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08QZQY1JF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":743859,"name":"LLADRÓ The Father Figurine. Porcelain Dad Figure.","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":690.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71dB07u26jL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A beautiful blend of strength and caring, the Lladro figurine called The Father pays tribute to the rich characteristics of paternal love. Created by sculptor Ernest Massuet, the piece is one of four in a series on the family, designed for combinations that fit individual households. With an eye to both introspective expression and physical beauty, Massuet chose matte white porcelain to complement the intricate and handsome figure of the father here. Cradling a sleeping infant in his lap, the man radiates love, calm, and vigor. He measures 8-3/4 by 10-3/4 inches overall and first entered the Lladro catalog in 2008. Coordinating mother, daughter, and son figurines are also available. Founded by a trio of Spanish brothers in 1953, Lladro is known the world over for superb craftsmanship and timeless images. Designed by artists and created by skilled artisans, each piece is fashioned in the company’s City of Porcelain workshops in Valencia. Perfect gifts and favorites with collectors, Lladro sculptures make treasured additions to the home and are sure to become heirlooms over the years.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71dB07u26jL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lladro","source_asin":"B001J6O1XQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-743859","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B001J6O1XQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B001J6O1XQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
